      "note": "",
      "createdAt": 1735582873698,
      "updatedAt": 1785053604577,
      "text": "The Mock Turtle sighed deeply, and drew the back of one flapper across his eyes. ",
      "xpointer0": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[1]/text().0",
      "xpointer1": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[1]/text().81"
    },
    {
      "id": "y03yib3",
      "type": "annotation",
      "cfi": "epubcfi(/6/26!/4/2/2[chapter_476]/4/2,/1:168,/1:228)",
      "note": "Gryphon",
      "createdAt": 1781788341520,
      "updatedAt": 1785053604577,
      "text": " “Same as if he had a bone in\nhis throat,” said the Gryphon;",
      "style": "highlight",
      "color": "violet",
      "xpointer0": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[1]/text().168",
      "xpointer1": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[1]/text().228"
    },
    {
      "id": "8v8065f",
      "type": "excerpt",
      "cfi": "epubcfi(/6/26!/4/2/2[chapter_476]/4/34,/1:0,/1:246)",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": 1770357700288,
      "updatedAt": 1785053608585,
      "text": "“Back to land again, and—that’s all the first figure,” said the\nMock Turtle, suddenly dropping his voice; and the two creatures,\nwho had been jumping about like mad things all this time, sat down\nagain very sadly and quietly, and looked at Alice.",
      "xpointer0": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[17]/text()[1].0",
      "xpointer1": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[17]/text()[1].246"
    },
    {
      "id": "1nmlotj",
      "type": "annotation",
      "cfi": "epubcfi(/6/26!/4/2/2[chapter_476]/4/98,/1:0,/1:94)",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": 1738178273743,
      "updatedAt": 1785053604577,
      "text": "“Thank you,” said Alice, “it’s very interesting. I never knew so much about a whiting before.”",
      "style": "highlight",
      "color": "yellow",
      "xpointer0": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[49]/text().0",
      "xpointer1": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[49]/text().94"
    },
    {
      "id": "h74sq2m",
      "type": "excerpt",
      "cfi": "epubcfi(/6/26!/4/2/2[chapter_476]/4/118,/1:0,/1:166)",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": 1735588980512,
      "updatedAt": 1785053606346,
      "text": "“If I’d been the whiting,” said Alice, whose thoughts were still running on the song, “I’d have said to the porpoise, ‘Keep back, please! We don’t want you with us!’”",
      "xpointer0": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[59]/text().0",
      "xpointer1": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[59]/text().166"
    },
    {
      "id": "u147gke",
      "type": "bookmark",
      "cfi": "epubcfi(/6/26!/4/2/2[chapter_476]/4,/122,/126/1:39)",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": 1773723402827,
      "updatedAt": 1785053608585,
      "text": "“Wouldn’t it really?” said Alice in a tone of great\nsurprise.",
      "xpointer0": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[61]",
      "xpointer1": "/body/DocFragment[13]/body/div/div/div/p[63]/text()[1].39"
    },
    {
      "id": "izlw32f",
      "type": "bookmark",
      "cfi": "epubcfi(/6/28!/4/2/2[chapter_478]/4,/20,/54/1:95)",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": 1774858712531,
      "updatedAt": 1785053608584,
      "text": "“Herald, read the accusation!” said the King.",
      "xpointer0": "/body/DocFragment[14]/body/div/div/div/p[10]",
      "xpointer1": "/body/DocFragment[14]/body/div/div/div/p[27]/text().95"
    },
    {
      "id": "8nzc958",
      "type": "annotation",
      "cfi": "epubcfi(/6/28!/4/2/2[chapter_478]/4/76,/1:0,/1:289)",
      "note": "This is interesting.",
      "createdAt": 1737811762080,
      "updatedAt": 1785053604577,
      "text": "All this time the Queen had never left off staring at the Hatter, and, just as the Dormouse crossed the court, she said, to one of the officers of the court, “Bring me the list of the singers in the last concert!” on which the wretched Hatter trembled so, that he shook off both his shoes.",
      "style": "highlight",
      "color": "yellow",
      "xpointer0": "/body/DocFragment[14]/body/div/div/div/p[38]/text()[1].0",
      "xpointer1": "/body/DocFragment[14]/body/div/div/div/p[38]/text()[1].289"
    },
    {
      "id": "zq2pjm0",
      "type": "annotation",
      "cfi": "epubcfi(/6/30!/4/2/2[chapter_480]/4/20,/1:0,/1:288)",
      "note": "",
      "createdAt": 1774579589852,
      "updatedAt": 1785053608585,
      "text": "“That’s very important,” the King said, turning to the jury.\nThey were just beginning to write this down on their slates, when\nthe White Rabbit interrupted: “Unimportant, your Majesty means, of\ncourse,” he said, in a very respectful tone, but frowning and\nmaking faces at him as he spoke.",
      "style": "highlight",
      "color": "yellow",
      "xpointer0": "/body/DocFragment[15]/body/div/div/div/p[10]/text().0",
      "xpointer1": "/body/DocFragment[15]/body/div/div/div/p[10]/text().288"
    },
    {
